{"id":"5bf8906d66a26c9e","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fibre-equality.md","title":"简单等式及族模型","display":"df-fibre-equality — 简单等式及族模型","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fibre-equality","aliases":["16-df-fibre-equality","Fibre equality"],"display":"df-fibre-equality — 简单等式及族模型","depends_on":["[[16-df-eq-functor]]","[[16-df-family-fibration]]","[[16-df-functor]]"],"source":"Definition 3.4.1 and family examples, pp. 190–195 (PDF 210–215)","revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fibre-equality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fibre-equality</span><span>Fibre equality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fibre-equality — 简单等式及族模型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d70ce677a3070a45\" href=\"?note=d70ce677a3070a45\" title=\"16-df-eq-functor\">16-df-eq-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"20083cb2a7d8b906\" href=\"?note=20083cb2a7d8b906\" title=\"16-df-family-fibration\">16-df-family-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 3.4.1 and family examples, pp. 190–195 (PDF 210–215)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为带有限积基范畴的纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasEq}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d70ce677a3070a45\" href=\"?note=d70ce677a3070a45\" title=\"16-df-eq-functor\">16-df-eq-functor</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>以下具体公式专用于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"20083cb2a7d8b906\" href=\"?note=20083cb2a7d8b906\" title=\"16-df-family-fibration\">16-df-family-fibration</a> 的集合族纤维化。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=I\\times J\">\\(D=I\\times J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(I\\times J)\\times J\">\\(V=(I\\times J)\\times J\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y,Z\">\\(Y,Z\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 上的集合族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=(f_{(i,j)})_{(i,j)\\in D}\">\\(f=(f_{(i,j)})_{(i,j)\\in D}\\)</span> 为从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 的逐点集合箭头族。纤维对象使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(D,Y)\">\\((D,Y)\\)</span> 的完整标签，垂直箭头使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle(D,Y),(D,Z),\\operatorname{id}_D,f\\rangle\">\\(\\langle(D,Y),(D,Z),\\operatorname{id}_D,f\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E(Y)\">\\(\\mathsf E(Y)\\)</span> 是下式定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 上的族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E(f)\">\\(\\mathsf E(f)\\)</span> 是相应的逐点箭头族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_{\\varnothing}\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_{\\varnothing}\\)</span> 为集合范畴中空集的恒等箭头。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasSimpleEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasSimpleEq}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibre\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{HasSimpleEq}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HasEq}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibre\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{HasSimpleEq}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HasEq}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E(Y)_{((i,j),j&#39;)}\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}Y_{(i,j)}&amp;j=j&#39;,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;j\\ne j&#39;.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf E(Y)_{((i,j),j&#39;)}\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}Y_{(i,j)}&amp;j=j&#39;,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;j\\ne j&#39;.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E(f)_{((i,j),j&#39;)}\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}f_{(i,j)}&amp;j=j&#39;,\\\\\\operatorname{id}_{\\varnothing}&amp;j\\ne j&#39;.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf E(f)_{((i,j),j&#39;)}\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}f_{(i,j)}&amp;j=j&#39;,\\\\\\operatorname{id}_{\\varnothing}&amp;j\\ne j&#39;.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J})_0(D,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq(V,\\mathsf E(Y)),\\\\\n(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J})_1\\langle(D,Y),(D,Z),\\operatorname{id}_D,f\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(V,\\mathsf E(Y)),(V,\\mathsf E(Z)),\\operatorname{id}_V,\\mathsf E(f)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J})_0,(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J})_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set})_D,\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set})_V)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J})_0(D,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq(V,\\mathsf E(Y)),\\\\\n(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J})_1\\langle(D,Y),(D,Z),\\operatorname{id}_D,f\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(V,\\mathsf E(Y)),(V,\\mathsf E(Z)),\\operatorname{id}_V,\\mathsf E(f)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J})_0,(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J})_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set})_D,\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set})_V)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>同型的箭头族只在对角上有数据，故与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\to\\delta_{I,J}^*Z\">\\(Y\\to\\delta_{I,J}^*Z\\)</span> 的箭头族自然双射；非对角分量由空集唯一给出。</li>\n<li>参数换基及 Frobenius 都逐点成立。此集合族不是预序纤维化，因此只说明它有简单等式，并非 Definition 3.5.1 的 Eq-fibration。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 3.4.1 and family examples, pp. 190–195 (PDF 210–215)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-eq-functor","status":"resolved","id":"d70ce677a3070a45","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-family-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"20083cb2a7d8b906","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-family-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-functor","status":"resolved","id":"d70ce677a3070a45","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带有限积基范畴的纤维化，$\\mathrm{HasEq}$ 见 [[16-df-eq-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-family-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"20083cb2a7d8b906","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"以下具体公式专用于 [[16-df-family-fibration]] 的集合族纤维化。令 $D=I\\times J$、$V=(I\\times J)\\times J$；$Y,Z$ 是 $D$ 上的集合族，$f=(f_{(i,j)})_{(i,j)\\in D}$ 为从 $Y$ 到 $Z$ 的逐点集合箭头族。纤维对象使用 $(D,Y)$ 的完整标签，垂直箭头使用 $\\langle(D,Y),(D,Z),\\operatorname{id}_D,f\\rangle$。$\\mathsf E(Y)$ 是下式定义的 $V$ 上的族，$\\mathsf E(f)$ 是相应的逐点箭头族；$\\operatorname{id}_{\\varnothing}$ 为集合范畴中空集的恒等箭头。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasEq}","display":false},{"tex":"D=I\\times J","display":false},{"tex":"V=(I\\times J)\\times J","display":false},{"tex":"Y,Z","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"f=(f_{(i,j)})_{(i,j)\\in D}","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"(D,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle(D,Y),(D,Z),\\operatorname{id}_D,f\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf E(Y)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf E(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}_{\\varnothing}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasSimpleEq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibre\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{HasSimpleEq}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HasEq}(p).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf E(Y)_{((i,j),j')}\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}Y_{(i,j)}&j=j',\\\\\\varnothing&j\\ne j'.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf E(f)_{((i,j),j')}\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}f_{(i,j)}&j=j',\\\\\\operatorname{id}_{\\varnothing}&j\\ne j'.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J})_0(D,Y)&\\coloneqq(V,\\mathsf E(Y)),\\\\\n(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J})_1\\langle(D,Y),(D,Z),\\operatorname{id}_D,f\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq\\langle(V,\\mathsf E(Y)),(V,\\mathsf E(Z)),\\operatorname{id}_V,\\mathsf E(f)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}&\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J})_0,(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J})_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set})_D,\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set})_V)&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"Y\\to\\delta_{I,J}^*Z","display":false}],"bytes":2469,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-230","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-fibre-equality|df-fibre-equality — 简单等式及族模型]]"}],"outgoing":["d70ce677a3070a45","20083cb2a7d8b906","fc49efccd7348d66"]}